title: "heb_rivok: Hebrew models for Tesseract"
message: "If you use these models, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Rivok Labs"
    website: "https://rivoklabs.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RivoksLab/tesseract-heb-rivok"
url: "https://huggingface.co/Rivok/tesseract-heb-rivok"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
keywords:
  - Hebrew
  - OCR
  - Tesseract
  - traineddata
  - LSTM
  - right-to-left
abstract: >-
  Two drop-in Tesseract 5 models for printed Hebrew, fine-tuned from Google's tessdata_best
  models: heb_rivok (Hebrew, English and digits, from script/Hebrew) and heb_rivok_lite
  (Hebrew and digits, from heb).
